  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's motion and perception capabilities, separating motion commands from sensor event outcomes. The specification binds sensor outcomes to safe, progress-oriented actions, prioritizing forward exploration and using conservative recovery only when needed. Recovery actions are one-shot and do not chain. Full rotation is reserved for repeated blockages. The design ensures safety, avoids oscillations, and maximizes coverage.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automata for motion and perception to reflect open-loop actuation and asynchronous sensing.",
    "Specification automata bind perception outcomes to safe, progress-oriented actions, enforcing conservative recovery and rapid return to exploration."
